zercher (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Faster indexing (parallel newline scan, ~15x on large files), ~50% less
    per-line metadata memory, editable input line with shared history and
    inline regex/case toggles for search/filter/highlight, syntax coloring
    for logfmt and JSON, Ctrl-Z suspend, height-aware wrap scrolling, and
    various bug fixes. Native Debian source package now included.

 -- Adi Zaimi <adizaimi@yahoo.com>  Mon, 07 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000

zercher (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: terminal log viewer with search, filters, highlights,
    bookmarks, time histogram, and a web-compatible --view string.

 -- Adi Zaimi <adizaimi@yahoo.com>  Thu, 03 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000
